"Measured on this Mac with sequential requests, as when typing. Each case keeps its category's app label, so a prompt is tested on every kind of text. Latency can differ by ~70 ms between runs (the system switches model modes). A full run takes about a minute; suggestions pause meanwhile." = "在这台 Mac 上按顺序发送请求进行测量，与键入时相同。每个用例都保留其类别的 App 标签，因此提示词会在每种文本上接受测试。每次运行的延迟可能相差约 70 ms（系统会切换模型模式）。完整运行大约需要一分钟，期间建议会暂停。";
