"in use" = "使用中";
"Load" = "载入";
"not benchmarked" = "未进行基准测试";
"next word %d%% (all)" = "下一个词 %d%%（全部）";
"corrected %d%%" = "已更正 %d%%";
"What the model is told to do, sent before every request. {words} becomes the number of words to suggest (General tab). Shorter instructions are faster: every token here costs time on each keystroke." = "告诉模型要做什么，在每个请求之前发送。{words} 会替换为建议的词数（“通用”标签页）。指令越短越快：这里的每个 token 在每次按键时都会耗费时间。";
"Sample inputs with the answer the model should give. The model copies their form closely: length, tone, and how a continuation starts. Each example adds to every request's time." = "示例输入以及模型应给出的答案。模型会严格模仿它们的形式：长度、语气以及续写的开头方式。每增加一个示例，每个请求的时间都会增加。";
"Runs the prompt on test cases and compares its answers with the expected ones, so you can see how a change to the prompt affects accuracy and speed before you rely on it." = "在测试用例上运行提示词，并将其答案与预期答案进行比较，让你在依赖它之前，就能看到对提示词的更改如何影响准确率和速度。";
"Example texts that come with Homeword (written for testing, no personal data), each cut at a point, with what was typed next. They cover chat, email, work documents, academic writing, code, general notes and terminal commands, plus 10 texts in each other language you write in, and results are shown per category. None of them is in a default prompt's examples. View… shows them." = "Homeword 附带的示例文本（为测试而编写，不含个人数据），每段都在某处截断，并附有接下来键入的内容。涵盖聊天、电子邮件、工作文档、学术写作、代码、一般笔记和终端命令，另外你使用的其他每种语言各有 10 段文本，结果按类别显示。它们都不在默认提示词的示例中。点按“查看…”即可查看。";
"Sentences with known mistakes that come with Homeword, and their corrected versions. The prompt runs on each and its output is compared with the correction. View… shows them." = "Homeword 附带的含已知错误的句子及其更正版本。提示词会在每个句子上运行，并将输出与更正版本进行比较。点按“查看…”即可查看。";
"Your own texts, as left = typed so far, right = what you would type next. They run as a separate section, so you can check a prompt on the kind of text you write. Stored on this Mac only." = "你自己的文本，左侧 = 目前已键入的内容，右侧 = 接下来要键入的内容。它们作为单独的部分运行，让你可以用自己常写的文本来检验提示词。仅存储在这台 Mac 上。";
"The last benchmark run of the prompt shown: your draft, your saved version, or the default. Small, noisy samples: a difference of one case is several percent." = "所显示提示词（你的草稿、你存储的版本或默认提示词）的上一次基准测试结果。样本少且有波动：相差一个用例就是好几个百分点。";
"Every Save keeps a version (the last 20) with its benchmark result, if you ran one. Load one to edit or compare it." = "每次存储都会保留一个版本（最近 20 个），如果运行过基准测试，还会保留其结果。载入一个版本即可编辑或比较。";
"The kind of text: chat messages, email, work documents, academic writing, code comments and commits, general notes, terminal commands; and each other language you write in." = "文本的种类：聊天消息、电子邮件、工作文档、学术写作、代码注释和提交、一般笔记、终端命令；以及你使用的其他每种语言。";
"All the built-in test cases together (your own cases are shown separately)." = "所有内置测试用例合计（你自己的用例单独显示）。";
"Your own test cases." = "你自己的测试用例。";
"How many texts ran in this row." = "这一行运行了多少段文本。";
"How often the first suggested word is exactly the word that was typed next (or the right end of an unfinished word). The main accuracy number." = "第一个建议的词与接下来键入的词（或未完成单词的正确剩余部分）完全一致的频率。这是主要的准确率指标。";
"How many suggested words in a row match what was typed, on average. Higher = more of a suggestion is worth accepting." = "平均有多少个连续的建议词与键入的内容一致。越高 = 建议中值得接受的部分越多。";
"Of the texts that end mid-word, how often the suggestion finishes that word correctly." = "在以半个单词结尾的文本中，建议正确补全该单词的频率。";
"How often there was a suggestion at all (the model may answer with nothing usable)." = "有建议出现的频率（模型可能给不出可用的答案）。";
"The median time from request to suggestion, in milliseconds: half of the suggestions came faster." = "从请求到建议出现的时间中位数，以毫秒为单位：一半的建议比这更快。";
"How often the output equals the corrected sentence exactly." = "输出与更正后的句子完全相同的频率。";
"How similar the output is to the corrected sentence, word by word (100% = identical)." = "输出与更正后的句子逐词相比的相似程度（100% = 完全相同）。";
"The output's length divided by the input's. Around 1.0 keeps the length; much lower means text was dropped." = "输出长度除以输入长度。约 1.0 表示长度不变；明显更低表示有文本被丢掉了。";
