"Choose every language you type in, and only those. Homeword works out which of them you are typing and suggests in that language; a short list keeps it from mixing up similar languages (Danish and Norwegian, Spanish and Portuguese)." = "选择你键入时使用的所有语言，并且只选这些语言。Homeword 会判断你正在用其中哪种语言键入，并以该语言提供建议；列表简短可以避免混淆相似的语言（如丹麦语和挪威语、西班牙语和葡萄牙语）。";
