"Words to suggest" = "建议的词数";
"How many words a suggestion can have after the word you are typing. Every word costs model time on each suggestion (about 16 ms per token, ~1.2 tokens per word), and words further ahead are right less often. The model stops earlier at the end of a sentence, so the cost is a maximum." = "一条建议在你正在键入的词之后最多可以包含多少个词。每个词都会增加每条建议的模型时间（每个 token 约 16 ms，每个词约 1.2 个 token），而且越靠后的词正确率越低。模型在句子结尾会提前停止，因此这是最大耗时。";
