"Some apps draw their text themselves and don't share it (Google Docs, Figma, Sublime Text, games). There Homeword uses what you typed since your last click instead, kept in memory only. It starts after the first word, resets on clicks, arrows, Return and shortcuts, and is off while an input method is active. The pop-up shows where you last clicked." = "有些 App 自行绘制文本且不共享（Google Docs、Figma、Sublime Text、游戏）。在这些 App 中，Homeword 会改用你自上次点按以来键入的内容，这些内容只保留在内存中。它在键入第一个词之后开始，在点按、按下箭头键、Return 和快捷键时重置，并在输入法处于活跃状态时关闭。弹出窗口会显示在你上次点按的位置。";
"Support Chrome-based browsers and Electron apps" = "支持基于 Chrome 的浏览器和 Electron App";
"Tab inserts the highlighted word, Esc dismisses. Typing the suggestion's next letters keeps it. The writing style follows the app you type in (Apps tab)." = "按 Tab 键插入高亮显示的词，按 Esc 关闭。继续键入建议中接下来的字母，建议会保留。写作风格会根据你键入时所用的 App 而定（“App”标签页）。";
