"Homeword picks a writing style for the app you type in, and for web apps in browsers (Gmail is Email, Google Docs is Work documents). Change it per app here, or turn suggestions off for an app." = "Homeword 会为你键入时所用的 App 以及浏览器中的网页 App 选择写作风格（Gmail 为“电子邮件”，Google Docs 为“工作文档”）。你可以在这里按 App 更改，或为某个 App 关闭建议。";
